> But can someone explain to me what a blog is?  

Well, the word is short for "weblog" but that
fact does not cover what the object named has
become.  It is a web site maintained by a single
person (or small organization) which contains a
frequently updated display of the maintainer's
spin on whatever he or she is interested in at
the moment.





           

